# SA-5510 SAVE: type a one-line program and SAVE it. The tape-write
# trap skips SA-1510's RECORD.PLAY wait (the ROM still prints
# WRITING "TEST"), writes saves/TEST.mzf (compared byte for byte) and
# BASIC returns to Ready. Lowercase letters arrive as capitals
# (authentic inverted shift).
420  type "10 print \"hi\""
540  key  Return
580  type "save \"test\""
700  key  Return
